hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"106","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abu Ja'far Muhammad bin Sudran Al-Basri, qaal: haddasana Talib bin Hujeer, 'an Hud wa huwa ibn 'Abdillah bin Sa'd, 'an jaddihi, qaal: Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam roze-fath ko Makkah mein dakhil hue aur unki talwar par sone aur chandi thi. Talib ne kaha: Main ne unse chandi ke baare mein poocha, to unhon ne farmaya: Talwar ki qabee'ah chandi ki thi."
"107","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Shuja' Al-Baghdadi, haddasana Abu 'Ubaidah Al-Haddad, 'an 'Uthman bin Sa'd, 'an Ibn Sireen, qaal: Main ne apni talwar Samurah bin Jundub ki talwar ke mutaabiq banai, aur Samurah ne daawa kiya ke unhone apni talwar Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ki talwar ke mutaabiq banayi thi, aur wo haneef (haan) tha. Haddasana 'Uqbah bin Mukarram Al-Basri, qaal: haddasana Muhammad bin Bakr, 'an 'Uthman bin Sa'd, isi isnaad se, is jaisa (bayan) marwi hai."
